          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: Two people observed on June 27, 2011, in the evening, a bright orange phenomenon flying in a straight line above them. No noise was heard during the observation which lasted one minute. The Thai lantern hypothesis is favored: red-orange appearance, shape, and movement according to the wind (north or northwest). The GEIPAN classifies this case as \"B\": probable observation of a Thai lantern.",
